change change.semctx.project-evidence-config
  statement: This contract recorded the planned v1-to-v2 candidate-selection migration and bounded project dogfooding evidence. It was superseded in PR #349 because that migration-specific intent did not govern subsequent catalogue work; supersession did not assert completed or verified migration. Current review follow-ups and dogfooding checks are carried by change.semctx.review-349-followups; the governing project policy and unresolved analysis limits remain recorded above.
  status: superseded
  provenance: author
  appliesAtLevel: 1
  serves: goal.semctx.honest-project-evidence
  serves: goal.semctx.reconstructive-control
  preserves: invariant.semctx.project-evidence-honesty
  preserves: invariant.semctx.fail-closed-control
  preserves: invariant.semctx.plane-separation
  requires: proof.semctx.project-config-native-checks
  unknown: unknown.semctx.project-negative-completeness
  unknown: unknown.semctx.project-analysis-boundaries
  tag: project-evidence

change change.semctx.review-349-followups
  statement: Resolve issue #359 follow-ups to review #349: share safe local Git base recommendations, preserve experimental ContextPack framing under accepted ADR 0005, record historical contract succession, and strengthen the affected regression tests; the package-identity analysis exception was explicitly authorized by Sebastien.
  status: active
  provenance: author
  serves: goal.semctx.honest-project-evidence
  preserves: invariant.semctx.project-evidence-honesty
  requires: proof.semctx.review-349-native-checks
  tag: issue-359

evidence proof.semctx.review-349-native-checks
  statement: On 2026-10-14, this checkout's index-record, server-metadata and guard tests passed under Bun 1.4.3 on macOS arm64 (134 passed, 2 platform skips). In a disposable worktree with the same affected source and assertions, the strengthened non-commit-ref test failed when commit verification was removed and passed after restoration; the Git-isolation test failed with isolation removed under hostile global core.hooksPath and passed after restoration; the dedicated experimental metadata test likewise detected removal of the experimental title. These observations are bounded native Bun evidence, not AssertLedger qualification, complete analysis coverage, remote CI or cross-platform proof.
  status: tested
  provenance: author
  appliesAtLevel: 1
  file: apps/cli/test/index-record.test.ts
  file: packages/mcp-server/test/server-metadata.test.ts
  file: plugins/claude-code/test/guard.test.ts
  tag: test
